{%- comment -%}
  Alpine Precision - topographic contour motif (brand signature).

  A main summit right of centre with a steep, tightly-spaced west face and a
  gentle, widely-spaced east apron; a ridge spur on the outer contours; a
  subsidiary knoll lower-left; and valley drainage running off the lower edge.
  Every third line is an index contour and carries a heavier stroke, as on a
  real topo sheet. Ring centres drift with elevation so nothing is concentric.

  Path data generated from a sampled radial elevation function, not hand-drawn.
  Pure SVG, no Liquid logic - rename to .tsx to port to Hydrogen. Colour comes
  from currentColor; position/opacity come from `.pattern-contour`
  (assets/alpine-core.css section 8).
{%- endcomment -%}
